  "description": "A member's CUSTODY_PUT to its hub carries the dest contact's home-hub hint (8 B, the hub's NodeId[0..8] from the contact's signed appdata) as ext TLV 0x02 in the hub-sealed put's inner header: type 0x02 ‖ len 8 ‖ value. n_ext (1 B) is present whenever HAS_EXT (flags bit 1) is set, so the hint costs 11 B when it is the only TLV and 10 B beside another TLV (C12). It never follows the payload: the payload is dest(32) ‖ item, and decode_put takes the rest as the item. The encoder writes TLV 0x01, then 0x02, then unknown TLVs. 'ext' is the n_ext ‖ TLVs region; 'wrap' = packet_len − item length (120 B without a TLV, CUSTODY_WRAP; 131 B with the hint alone). 'reject' lists inner-before-auth bytes the codec refuses: 0x02 on any kind other than CUSTODY_PUT (0x03), a length other than 8, the type twice. 'expect' is the Debug form of mesh111::envelope::EnvelopeError. pair_mac and pair key as in ../envelope.json; epk is a fixed stand-in for the sealer's ephemeral.",
